---
const portrait = '/about-portrait.png';
---

<section class="about">
  <div class="about__container">
    <div class="about__content">
      <h2 class="about__title">Our approach</h2>
      <div class="about__body">
        <p>Freshen is rooted in strong client relationships and a collaborative, enjoyable design process.</p>
        <p>We believe great design should be exciting, livable, and practical—balancing creativity with real-world function so your home works just as good as it looks.</p>
        <p>From space planning and finish selections to custom interiors and styling, Freshen Interiors &amp; Design delivers thoughtful, personalized design solutions tailored to your lifestyle.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img class="about__media" src={portrait} alt="" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 112px 64px 0;
    background-color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .about__container {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 752px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about__content {
    max-width: 624px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .about__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 52px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: #0c0c0b;
  }

  .about__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1em;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(12, 12, 11, 0.75);
  }

  .about__body p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about__media {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 576px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      padding: 64px 24px 0;
    }

    .about__container {
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .about__content {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .about__media {
      position: static;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 32px auto 0;
    }

    .about__title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
    }
  }
</style>
